ados podem sofrer alterações sem aviso prévio”.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/14264cb6-ccfa-450e-95ab-9b9fcee035b9.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5996259a-c285-4f4f-b77f-c217f0fdb79b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/77e16685-0869-49ba-94b8-7d6e42338ab2.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/83bd7c09-f0e9-435a-a1f3-95fa29082879.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/fd6ecfb4-188f-4826-8bbd-7ed7c306882f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0f78d9a1-96fd-4e87-b4ce-6cc06ad40e90.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/788355db-2e00-439e-a13d-7b59b8e182f8.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/dee32649-7e93-4895-96d4-b26bae4e1447.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/78f5783e-08a8-4da8-81ec-8fc79bee6020.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/88f30aeb-ed98-420f-bbeb-76c5e75634a6.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1d64b352-ec40-4267-871f-3c4dea4b400c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b1812686-4ac5-43e0-bae0-ea042aa7d9b7.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aa9ca832a4d98487e482ac9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/53655945-a141-4cce-b2f1-5216bd949a59.jpeg","http